data: {"type":"streamAssistantItem","item":"event","value":{"event":"end","part":1,"content":{"type":"text","text":"Both are called **Warden**, but they guard different places and enforce different rules:\n\n- **Oren Dask** guards the **Sablecross reservoir**. He refuses to let soldiers draw water without a **council permit**.\n- **Lysa Renn** keeps the **Sun Archive**. Civilian scholars may enter **during daylight only**.\n\nThey are **unrelated**; the shared title doesn’t mean they share a role."}}}

data: {"type":"streamAssistantItem","item":"event","value":{"event":"end","part":0,"content":{"type":"reasoning","text":"**Explaining the lore access rules**\n\nI need to provide an explanation about the lore concerning Oren guarding the reservoir. Soldiers need a council permit to draw water, and Oren enforces this rule strictly. Lysa, who keeps the archives, allows civilian scholars access only during the day. It's important to differentiate between Oren and Lysa since they have distinct roles, and both are unrelated to the alias Warden. I’ll make sure to clarify these specific access rules!","native":{"item":{"reasoning":"**Explaining the lore access rules**\n\nI need to provide an explanation about the lore concerning Oren guarding the reservoir. Soldiers need a council permit to draw water, and Oren enforces this rule strictly. Lysa, who keeps the archives, allows civilian scholars access only during the day. It's important to differentiate between Oren and Lysa since they have distinct roles, and both are unrelated to the alias Warden. I’ll make sure to clarify these specific access rules!","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.summary","summary":"**Explaining the lore access rules**\n\nI need to provide an explanation about the lore concerning Oren guarding the reservoir. Soldiers need a council permit to draw water, and Oren enforces this rule strictly. Lysa, who keeps the archives, allows civilian scholars access only during the day. It's important to differentiate between Oren and Lysa since they have distinct roles, and both are unrelated to the alias Warden. I’ll make sure to clarify these specific access rules!","format":"openai-responses-v1","index":0},{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"gAAAAABq4zXR3gTZhXGE3Bb8opQ5KUtzRAkiGGWOhQH8YF7h7qRLFdpCOmAvZrTBFqme9sOscgF-0mMyX4BcwD_apw2z__gEsV3D5RuTMwkll3Q7DF3qOh5Wk2Su-82YYIFxVDbERDZAMx9R8ah8Xj-qOO1HdffV4bGAekJ8X3cn-iHmkGGFRxOjl96FLZOS9RpGtA6-3imqG2tgISuw01-tIA83AM_dkMbEnUOPVDJPELf2kMlIz0wm-ExDKOBV2cmiDWXIA